<title>POLAND: RELPOL GROUP JUNE NET UP TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL GROUP JUNE NET UP TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary group results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.72 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.77 vs   0.98</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.06 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Sales		    7.89 vs   3.34</p>
